# The tokenizer's test data is read for the bytes it pins, never edited as prose,
# so git must not convert its line endings at checkout. Model.Hash is the digest
# of falcon-tokenizer.json as committed, and a Windows checkout in CRLF hashes
# to something else than the one the parity test expects. gen_corpus is source,
# so it stays text.
tokenizer/testdata/*.json -text
tokenizer/testdata/*.bin -text
